  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "FAMILY_MEMBER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Hello doctor. This is my son Arjun, he's seven. He starts wheezing whenever he runs around, and it worries me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you for bringing him. Hello Arjun, how are you feeling today? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good lad. Mum, can you tell me what the wheezing is like?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "It's a whistling sound from his chest, after he's been running for a few minutes at school."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long does it last once he stops?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Ten minutes or so, then it settles."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Has it happened at night, or when he has a cold?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "When he has a cold, yes, he gets a cough with it. But not usually at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Arjun, does it hurt when you wheeze? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, it just feels tight. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does he take anything for it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "A blue inhaler, salbutamol, two puffs when he needs it, with a spacer. He has used it a few times."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does the inhaler help? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Yes, within a few minutes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does anyone in the family have asthma or eczema?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "His mother, that's me, had asthma as a child, and his father has hay fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does Arjun have any allergies, to medicines or food?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "A rash after eating peanuts when he was three. We've avoided them since."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. That's important. Does he have any other conditions? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Eczema, when he was a baby. It's gone now. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to listen to his chest and check his oxygen. Arjun, can you take big breaths for me? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay.",
   "pause": 14.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Oxygen 98 percent, pulse 90, breathing 22 a minute. His chest is clear now, no wheeze."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "So it's gone? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Between episodes it often is. From what you describe, this sounds like exercise-induced asthma."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is it dangerous? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's common and very treatable. He should take two puffs of the salbutamol with the spacer ten minutes before sport."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "The school should know about that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll write a letter for the school. And I'd like to see him again in four weeks, to see how he's getting on."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If he's struggling to speak, or the inhaler isn't helping, call an ambulance."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I understand. ~"
  }
 ],
